{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO NEMO ULTRA \u2013 YOUR GRAVE, OR YOUR PROVING GROUND.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.poster.avif?t=1771614859\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.webm?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.mp4?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER. EVOLVE. ESCAPE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Tetsuo: The Iron Man and Escape from New York, Voltage High Society thrusts you into a perilous battle against cybernetic monsters. Unravel the secrets of the island, gain powerful weapons and abilities, and seek the ultimate prize: freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Genre Fusion:</strong> Experience an innovative blend of first-person fighting, Metroidvania exploration, and immersive cyberpunk aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Visuals:</strong> Marvel at a unique art style that seamlessly blends nostalgic retro design with modern, edgy graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Engage in fast-paced, tactical battles against an array of menacing cybernetic monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Horror-Infused Gameplay:</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling gaming experience enriched with unsettling body horror elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deep Exploration and Progression:</strong> Unlock new areas, discover hidden secrets, and acquire potent abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW WEAPONS, ABILITIES &amp; LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast, interconnected world in true Metroidvania fashion. Unlock new areas, master innovative combat techniques, and solve intriguing puzzles as you acquire a diverse arsenal of weapons and abilities. The power to overcome the island's treacherous challenges lies within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT CYBERNETIC HORRORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, dynamic combat that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Encounter a vast array of monstrous designs, each one more menacing than the last. With an emphasis on strategy and skill, Voltage High Society offers more than just aim-and-shoot gameplay \u2013 it's a true test of your mettle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRITTY RETRO AESTHETICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in the game's unique aesthetics, blending retro and modern visuals to create an unforgettable atmosphere. Traverse through dark, gritty environments teeming with malevolent creatures, and then experience a sudden shift to vibrant, colorful worlds filled with adrenaline-pumping arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.poster.avif?t=1771614859\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.webm?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.mp4?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gary the Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063480/589f0dc0178ce7cc4323ca0c9571de67b7944918.jpg"},{"name":"Tio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063480/985eba41af548e80e900db4ed79401e621706d26.jpg"},{"name":"Disco","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063480/921978b02eb105d2e4357b86419e93756684c273.jpg"},{"name":"J. Cricket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063480/a342a9147eef9bc4f4b30e35428d9d91ac3ce858.jpg"},{"name":"The Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063480/dc346205a6e465f90c136d9c1d7bc7f2f877eb9f.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2063480?t=1771614859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2063480?t=1771614859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771614859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771614859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Fighting against cybernetic monsters and frightening sequences."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core experience of brutal combat and Metroidvania exploration is here! Current progress (Update 7):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY: ~90%</strong> - Main narrative threads are in place, with more revelations to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AREAS: ~90%</strong> - A substantial portion of Nemo Ultra is ready to be explored and conquered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYER UPGRADES: 95%</strong> - A vast array of game-changing abilities and weapons are at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYSTEM POLISH: 96%</strong> - We're constantly refining controls, performance, and overall feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONSTERS: 90%</strong> - Prepare to face a diverse and challenging roster of cybernetic foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SECRETS: ?</strong> - Many are hidden, and more are on the way...</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO NEMO ULTRA \u2013 YOUR GRAVE, OR YOUR PROVING GROUND.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.poster.avif?t=1771614859\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.webm?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/312ac271b1d8493cc7becfd6bfa885bc.mp4?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER. EVOLVE. ESCAPE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Tetsuo: The Iron Man and Escape from New York, Voltage High Society thrusts you into a perilous battle against cybernetic monsters. Unravel the secrets of the island, gain powerful weapons and abilities, and seek the ultimate prize: freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Genre Fusion:</strong> Experience an innovative blend of first-person fighting, Metroidvania exploration, and immersive cyberpunk aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Visuals:</strong> Marvel at a unique art style that seamlessly blends nostalgic retro design with modern, edgy graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Engage in fast-paced, tactical battles against an array of menacing cybernetic monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Horror-Infused Gameplay:</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling gaming experience enriched with unsettling body horror elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deep Exploration and Progression:</strong> Unlock new areas, discover hidden secrets, and acquire potent abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW WEAPONS, ABILITIES &amp; LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast, interconnected world in true Metroidvania fashion. Unlock new areas, master innovative combat techniques, and solve intriguing puzzles as you acquire a diverse arsenal of weapons and abilities. The power to overcome the island's treacherous challenges lies within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT CYBERNETIC HORRORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, dynamic combat that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Encounter a vast array of monstrous designs, each one more menacing than the last. With an emphasis on strategy and skill, Voltage High Society offers more than just aim-and-shoot gameplay \u2013 it's a true test of your mettle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRITTY RETRO AESTHETICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in the game's unique aesthetics, blending retro and modern visuals to create an unforgettable atmosphere. Traverse through dark, gritty environments teeming with malevolent creatures, and then experience a sudden shift to vibrant, colorful worlds filled with adrenaline-pumping arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.poster.avif?t=1771614859\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.webm?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/9a9bc7bea58bf68edae2b488088ef67c.mp4?t=1771614859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Platonic Partnership"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/header.jpg?t=1771614859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2063480/95201885/3568b83a97b0c8c9447706cf075527ee5cd170b6/1769723026/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769723242","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2063480/95201885/3568b83a97b0c8c9447706cf075